Chromium 159 cronet-go desktop customizations

Base Chromium: 159.0.8154.34 (4deb883708d3d25100c5aac2148aafc95dae95ac)
Base BoringSSL: 7968531b8f882e3ab4c38fac8d8674231f40442e
Restored native C ABI / grpc_support: 144.0.7559.0

Apply from a clean, dependency-synchronized Chromium src directory:
    git apply --check /path/to/cronet-go/2.patch
    git apply /path/to/cronet-go/2.patch

Includes restored compatibility sources, desktop targets, macOS CLT support,
proxy authentication, explicit certificate override, HTTP/2 SETTINGS/GREASE,
and TLS cipher/group configuration including nested BoringSSL modifications.
Excludes DEPS download filtering, toolchains, build outputs, and Go bindings.
BoringSSL paths are relative to Chromium src; do not apply the nested part twice.
GN args and packaging remain managed by cronet-go/scripts/build_cronet.py.

